{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"linkOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" is a function which type checks an object literal with the intention of being used for "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Link"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"navigate"},{"type":"text","value":" or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"redirect"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"linkoptions-props","children":[{"type":"text","value":"linkOptions props"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"linkOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" accepts the following option:"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"props","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"...props"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"LinkProps & React.RefAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./LinkPropsType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"LinkProps"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"linkoptions-returns","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"linkOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An object literal with the exact type inferred from the input"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const userLinkOptions = linkOptions({\n  to: '/dashboard/users/user',\n  search: {\n    usersView: {\n      sortBy: 'email',\n      filterBy: 'filter',\n    },\n    userId: 0,\n  },\n})\n\nfunction DashboardComponent() {\n  return <Link {...userLinkOptions} />\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"linkoptions-props","text":"linkOptions props","level":2},{"id":"props","text":"...props","level":3},{"id":"linkoptions-returns","text":"linkOptions returns","level":2},{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n`linkOptions` is a function which type checks an object literal with the intention of being used for `Link`, `navigate` or `redirect`\n\n## linkOptions props\n\nThe `linkOptions` accepts the following option:\n\n### `...props`\n\n- Type: `LinkProps & React.RefAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>`\n- [`LinkProps`](./LinkPropsType.md)\n\n## `linkOptions` returns\n\nAn object literal with the exact type inferred from the input\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nconst userLinkOptions = linkOptions({\n  to: '/dashboard/users/user',\n  search: {\n    usersView: {\n      sortBy: 'email',\n      filterBy: 'filter',\n    },\n    userId: 0,\n  },\n})\n\nfunction DashboardComponent() {\n  return <Link {...userLinkOptions} />\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: linkOptions\ntitle: Link options\n---\n\n`linkOptions` is a function which type checks an object literal with the intention of being used for `Link`, `navigate` or `redirect`\n\n## linkOptions props\n\nThe `linkOptions` accepts the following option:\n\n### `...props`\n\n- Type: `LinkProps & React.RefAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>`\n- [`LinkProps`](./LinkPropsType.md)\n\n## `linkOptions` returns\n\nAn object literal with the exact type inferred from the input\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nconst userLinkOptions = linkOptions({\n  to: '/dashboard/users/user',\n  search: {\n    usersView: {\n      sortBy: 'email',\n      filterBy: 'filter',\n    },\n    userId: 0,\n  },\n})\n\nfunction DashboardComponent() {\n  return <Link {...userLinkOptions} />\n}\n```\n"}
